# Registered-evaluation run records (pnpm phase4:run). Tens of megabytes each
# -- heldout-a is ~39 MB -- and fully re-derivable from the dataset plus the
# committed code and artifact. SRCLA-REPORT.{md,json} at the repo root are the
# committed outputs; these are the verifiable intermediates behind them.
evaluation-heldout-*.json
phase4-run.log

# Scored-grid sidecars from `pnpm phase4:freeze` (see scripts/freeze-artifact.ts).
#
# DELIBERATE (P18/M2): the REGISTERED artifact's sidecar is COMMITTED as
# evidence. It is ~110 KB, it is the only record of how the registered
# selection was reached -- every per-term IQR, every candidate's normalized
# z-scores and its realised decision score -- and reproducing it costs a
# ~75-minute sweep. A sidecar written beside any OTHER artifact path is
# iteration output and is not evidence of anything registered.
config/*.grid.json
!config/registered-artifact.grid.json
